flowchart LR
    A[Search Product] --> B[Compare Options]
    B --> C[Check Availability]
    C --> D[Add to Cart]
    D --> E[Apply Coupon]
    E --> F[Confirm Delivery Promise]
    F --> G[Authorize Payment]
    G --> H[Reserve Inventory]
    H --> I[Confirm Order]
    I --> J[Track Delivery]

    C -. trust risk .-> C1[Inventory Accuracy]
    F -. trust risk .-> F1[Delivery Promise]
    G -. trust risk .-> G1[Payment Authorization]
    I -. trust risk .-> I1[Order Commitment]
